  "title": "Add preference to disable background colors in Expert Info messages",
  "description": "This merge request adds a new GUI preference (`expert_info_disable_background_color`) that allows users to disable background colors in Expert Info messages, for a less visually noisy tree.\n\nChanges include:\n- New preference registered in `prefs.c` / `prefs.h`\n- Logic applied in `proto_tree_model.cpp`\n- Option added to Preferences dialog UI",
